    "notes": "<h3>Champion | Standard</h3>\n<p><em>A mockery of humanity with gangly, long limbs.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Devour, hunt, track</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 17 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 12/23 | <strong>HP:</strong> 3 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Bite &amp; Claw: Melee | 2d6+5 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Copycat +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Unnatural - Passive</strong>: The Ghoul is resistant to physical damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Overwhelm - Passive</strong>: When a target the Ghoul attacks has other adversaries within Very Close range, deal double damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Lurching Lunge - Action</strong>: Mark a Stress to spotlight the Ghoul as an additional GM move instead of spending Fear.</p>\n",
